{"build_state":"not_built","id":"urn:uuid:ccdbeb43-f0eb-56a4-8834-7449d1fd7730","interchange_state":"structurally_verified","language_state":"draft_translated","locale":"id-ID","math_state":"not_applicable","protected_token_shape_equal":true,"protected_tokens":[],"provenance":"local Codex translation requested by Floris","publication_state":"unpublished","record_type":"localization","schema_id":"ttna-localization-v1","schema_version":"1.0.0","segment_id":"urn:uuid:711a13e6-4792-5d49-94f4-7ebd49b3ae6b","source_segment_sha256":"8cfa223f44f287c2ad048f92c7f7997c7dcaf6e42f20ab90f5e6aa9794277fcf","structure_state":"structurally_verified","target_block_sha256":"6f6436dadd6b8c91fb4fe433faffb10b99d11c47134b1ac43479eca655e8e8a1","target_locator":{"end_line":510,"layout":"Standard","layout_ordinal":20,"start_line":497},"target_path":"translation/lyx-id/preface.lyx","target_text":"CoCalc (Collaborative Calculation in the Cloud) menyediakan akses ke Octave, R, SageMath, \\SpecialChar LaTeX, C++, Julia, dan berbagai kernel lainnya. CoCalc menghadirkan lingkungan yang jauh lebih lengkap, termasuk fitur pengelolaan kelas seperti pembuatan kelas, pembagian dan pengumpulan tugas, serta penyuntingan kolaboratif; secara keseluruhan, tersedia seperangkat alat minimum untuk menyelenggarakan perkuliahan. Layanan ini menawarkan akses akun gratis maupun berbayar. Meskipun mereka memperingatkan bahwa akun gratis mungkin berjalan lambat, akun tersebut mungkin tetap sesuai dengan kebutuhan Anda. Berdasarkan pengalaman saya, akun gratis memerlukan cukup banyak kesabaran karena masalah koneksi dan pelambatan tidak terelakkan.","target_text_sha256":"b1f54cbc7d8e1865c0a34529696ffec2af849cb8038d78a0e4152e140397e320","workflow_state":"translated"}
{"edition_id":"urn:uuid:35b4350d-7202-5d47-8b85-5262d7ca441c","id":"urn:uuid:cd1ecff9-b8b9-533d-bd66-f6e9ee4e52be","order":2,"protected_tokens":[],"record_type":"segment","rights_id":"urn:uuid:52a7c815-5b13-5f21-a52a-e7fa11238e07","schema_id":"ttna-segment-v1","schema_version":"1.0.0","semantic_slot":"paragraph","source_block_sha256":"9c07b70cbdaa9eb5ed199c6c5f597ecbaa122a6b65296f319cf78dc485fb98f8","source_file_id":"urn:uuid:271e812b-1ccd-53ed-a402-07fe58709c8a","source_locale":"en-US","source_locator":{"end_line":455,"layout":"Standard","layout_ordinal":16,"start_line":448},"source_text":"Perhaps the easiest way to get started using Octave is through a web browser. This approach has the advantage of quick startup, no installation, and very modest hardware requirements. Online Octave environments can be run on the most powerful workstations or on a phone. As of this writing, there are at least two free online platforms available.","source_text_sha256":"262650a648871ee8a98a1f08f5fb334c3a6edda46b579caeeaac78a69b7d0313","translation_state":"source_frozen","unit_id":"urn:uuid:309948d3-a03e-5749-a53b-6f5dcf605717"}
